# Original source photos (~25 MB) live at the repo root and are NOT part of
# the published site -- photos/ holds the converted, resized, EXIF-stripped
# copies that actually get served. Keep your own backup of the originals
# somewhere safe: tools/preprocess.py needs them to regenerate photos/.
/*.JPG
/*.JPEG
/*.PNG
/*.HEIC
/att.*

__pycache__/
*.pyc